  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0154_0a7125203942.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 198px;\" /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0154_dcd69c1b296f.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 95px;\" /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <msub> <mtext>F</mtext> <mtext>net</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>2Fcos</mtext> <mi>&#952;</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>y</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8776;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Net force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>&nbsp;is opposite the direction of displacement&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>. Hence, negative sign is used.</p>"
